meta {
  name: Agent Integration
  seq: 4
}

docs {
  End-to-end checks of agent mode against a real, running ai-agent-lab service
  (AI-Demo on 8080 with AGENT_LAB_ENABLED=true, the lab on 8081).

  The requests run only with the LocalAgent environment; with any other environment they are
  skipped in collection runs, so `bru run --env Local` keeps working without the lab.

  The answers come from a real model, which decides what to say and whether to search, so the
  checks cover only what the two services guarantee (status, contract fields, token usage,
  web source rules, validation), never the wording. Each run calls the real OpenAI API
  through the lab and usually uses one Tavily web search credit.
}
